            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PRZLdZJxqoGsFwxrDvplsMDfgkh\">Overall, there are several differences between the layouts of the houses, as the modern <strong>design</strong> is mostly open plan downstairs and there are more rooms upstairs. In both modern and traditional houses, <strong>the so-called traditional rooms with sliding doors</strong><strong> </strong>double as living areas and bedrooms, with foldaway futon beds which are stored in cupboards when not in use.</div>\n</div>",
