            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-MV6ddR5BNoaypkxjivHlXk9ngob\">Upstairs, the traditional layout features two <strong>tatami bedrooms</strong> with sliding doors, each with its own futon cupboard. In the <strong>contemporary</strong> layout, by contrast, there are two smaller bedrooms instead of one large one <strong>at the top of the floor plan</strong>, all with modern western-style beds. On the opposite side, what originally was the other bedroom is now a master bedroom with a private bathroom, and a separate bathroom opposite the stairs.</div>\n</div>",
